  concentration, dependency according to ADL scores, dietary intake, swallowing capacities and oral status were         
  collected. Swallowing capacities and dietary intake were reassessed 1\xa0week after.   Results Mean age was 85.28     
  (SD 5.68). Seventy‐seven patients were malnourished (MNA) and 34 had dysphagia. Oral treatment was necessary in 142   
